#: ../../topics/domains.rst:223
msgid ""
"The Rust domain describes crates as rustdoc presents them. Each directive "
"takes the declaration as Rust writes it, on one line, visibility and "
"qualifiers included. Targets are full paths with ``::``, the crate's name "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Rust 域按照 rustdoc 的呈现方式描述 crate。每个指令都接受 Rust 原样写法的声明，写在一行内，包括可见性和限定符。目标是用 "
"``::`` 连接的完整路径，以 crate 名开头。"

#: ../../topics/domains.rst:258
msgid ""
"Directives include: ``rust:crate``, ``rust:module``, ``rust:function``, "
"``rust:method``, ``rust:struct``, ``rust:enum``, ``rust:variant``, "
"``rust:union``, ``rust:trait``, ``rust:impl``, ``rust:type``, "
"``rust:const``, ``rust:static``, ``rust:macro``, ``rust:field``, "
"``rust:associatedtype``, ``rust:associatedconst``, and ``rust:use``. "
"Options include ``:visibility:``, ``:cfg:``, ``:unsafe:``, ``:async:``, "
"``:const:``, ``:provided:``, ``:attributes:``, ``:deprecated:``, "
"``:for:``, ``:trait:``, ``:target:``, and ``:noindex:``. An ``impl`` is "
"never a target itself. Its members belong to the type."
msgstr ""
"指令包括：``rust:crate``、``rust:module``、``rust:function``、``rust:method``、``rust:struct``、``rust:enum``、``rust:variant``、``rust:union``、``rust:trait``、``rust:impl``、``rust:type``、``rust:const``、``rust:static``、``rust:macro``、``rust:field``、``rust:associatedtype``、``rust:associatedconst`` "
"和 ``rust:use``。选项包括 "
"``:visibility:``、``:cfg:``、``:unsafe:``、``:async:``、``:const:``、``:provided:``、``:attributes:``、``:deprecated:``、``:for:``、``:trait:``、``:target:`` "
"和 ``:noindex:``。``impl`` 本身从不是目标，它的成员归属于对应的类型。"

