#: ../../topics/music.rst:61
msgid "Choose the notation"
msgstr "选择记谱方式"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:64
msgid ""
"The default pitch language is Nederlands: ``cis`` is C sharp and ``des`` "
"is D flat. We select English names with ``\\language \"english\"`` or "
"``\\include \"english.ly\"``; examples include ``cs`` and ``df``. Deutsch "
"adds ``h`` for B natural and ``b`` for B flat. These three language "
"includes are built in and read no file."
msgstr ""
"默认音名语言是 Nederlands：``cis`` 表示升 C，``des`` 表示降 D。我们用 ``\\language "
"\"english\"`` 或 ``\\include \"english.ly\"`` 选择英语音名，例如 ``cs`` 和 "
"``df``。Deutsch 添加 ``h`` 表示本位 B，``b`` 表示降 B。这三种语言包含项是内置的，不读取文件。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:69
msgid ""
"Apostrophes raise octaves and commas lower them. ``\\fixed c' { ... }`` "
"fixes the reference octave instead of following preceding pitches. "
"``\\transpose c ees { ... }`` transposes spelled pitches and key "
"signatures. Accidentals belong to the pitch name; a key signature does "
"not change a written natural pitch into a sharp pitch. An exclamation "
"mark forces an accidental, and a question mark requests a cautionary "
"accidental. We put these marks after the pitch and before its duration: "
"``cis'!4`` and ``c'?4``."
msgstr ""
"撇号升高八度，逗号降低八度。``\\fixed c' { ... }`` 固定参照八度，不再跟随前面的音高。``\\transpose c ees "
"{ ... }`` "
"对书写音高和调号进行移调。变音记号属于音名；调号不会把明确写出的本位音变成升音。感叹号强制显示变音记号，问号请求提示性变音记号。这些符号写在音高之后、时值之前：``cis'!4`` "
"和 ``c'?4``。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:76
msgid ""
"Durations range from ``1`` through ``128``, with ``\\breve`` for a double "
"whole note. Dots lengthen a duration, and ``*2/3`` scales its exact "
"value. ``r`` is a rest, ``s`` is an invisible spacer, and ``R1*4`` "
"requests four measures of rest in common time. Angle brackets make "
"chords: ``<c' e' g'>4``. ``q`` repeats the preceding chord. A tilde ties "
"equal pitches; parentheses make slurs, and ``\\(`` with ``\\)`` makes a "
"phrasing slur."
msgstr ""
"时值范围为 ``1`` 到 ``128``，``\\breve`` 表示二全音符。附点延长时值，``*2/3`` 按比例缩放其精确值。``r`` "
"表示休止符，``s`` 表示不可见占位符，``R1*4`` 请求四四拍中的四小节休止。尖括号构成和弦：``<c' e' g'>4``。``q`` "
"重复前一个和弦。波浪号连接同音高音符；圆括号形成连音线，``\\(`` 和 ``\\)`` 形成分句线。"

