#: ../../topics/music.rst:106
msgid ""
"The reader accepts version declarations, ignored header metadata and "
"empty layout or MIDI blocks. It refuses Scheme, music functions, "
"arbitrary property changes, overrides and unsupported commands with a "
"placed diagnostic. The profile describes a fixed engraving style; it does "
"not execute a LilyPond program. The complete command ledger and engraving "
"contract are recorded in GDS 0015 in the repository's "
"``docs/gds/records`` directory."
msgstr ""
"读取器接受版本声明、忽略的头部元数据，以及空的布局或 MIDI 块。它拒绝 "
"Scheme、音乐函数、任意属性修改、覆盖设置和不支持的命令，并给出带源码位置的诊断。该子集描述固定的乐谱排印风格，不执行 LilyPond "
"程序。完整命令表和排印约定记录在仓库 ``docs/gds/records`` 目录中的 GDS 0015。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:111
msgid "Add expression and repeats"
msgstr "添加表情与反复"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:114
msgid ""
"We attach articulations and fingerings after a note: ``-.`` is staccato, "
"``->`` is an accent, and ``-1`` selects the first finger. Dynamics set "
"the intensity, and a hairpin continues until ``\\!`` or the next dynamic. "
"We place a small grace group before a main note with ``\\grace``; "
"``\\acciaccatura`` adds a slash, while ``\\afterGrace`` places the group "
"after its main note. Grace time does not extend the measure."
msgstr ""
"我们在音符之后添加奏法记号和指法：``-.`` 表示断奏，``->`` 表示重音，``-1`` 选择第一指。力度记号设置强度，渐强或渐弱线延续至 "
"``\\!`` 或下一个力度记号。我们用 ``\\grace`` 在主音前放置小装饰音组；``\\acciaccatura`` "
"添加斜线，``\\afterGrace`` 则把音组放在其主音之后。装饰音的时间不延长小节。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:126
msgid ""
"We write a volta repeat once and give each ending in ``\\alternative``; "
"``\\volta 1,2 { ... }`` labels combined endings, and ``\\fine`` or "
"``\\section`` marks a structural double bar. The example has two passes "
"with different final measures. ``\\repeat unfold`` expands its body "
"instead of drawing repeat signs, and ``\\compressEmptyMeasures`` or "
"``\\compressFullBarRests`` is accepted for multi-measure rests. Chord "
"names use a separate ``\\new ChordNames \\chordmode`` context beside the "
"staff, with spellings such as ``c1:maj7``, ``d:m7`` and ``g:7``."
msgstr ""
"我们只书写一次反复主体，并在 ``\\alternative`` 中给出各个结尾；``\\volta 1,2 { ... }`` "
"用于标注合并的遍次，``\\fine`` 或 ``\\section`` 用于标记结构双纵线。示例演奏两遍，末小节各不相同。``\\repeat "
"unfold`` 展开其正文而不绘制反复记号，多小节休止也接受 ``\\compressEmptyMeasures`` 或 "
"``\\compressFullBarRests``。和弦名称在谱表旁使用独立的 ``\\new ChordNames \\chordmode`` "
"上下文，写法如 ``c1:maj7``、``d:m7`` 和 ``g:7``。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:138
