#: ../../topics/music.rst:172
msgid "Combine staves and lyrics"
msgstr "组合谱表与歌词"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:175
msgid ""
"We use simultaneous contexts for a score with several staves. Instrument "
"names use ``instrumentName`` and ``shortInstrumentName`` in a ``\\with`` "
"block. Two voices on one staff use ``<< { ... } \\\\ { ... } >>``. Lyrics "
"attach to a named voice, and separate ``\\lyricsto`` expressions make "
"separate verses."
msgstr ""
"我们用同时发生的上下文表示多个谱表的总谱。乐器名称在 ``\\with`` 块中使用 ``instrumentName`` 和 "
"``shortInstrumentName``。同一谱表的两个声部使用 ``<< { ... } \\\\ { ... } "
">>``。歌词附加到有名称的声部，不同的 ``\\lyricsto`` 表达式形成不同的歌词段落。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:181
msgid ""
"Two piano staves; the upper staff has four quarter notes and the words "
"Sing a short song, while the bass holds C."
msgstr "两个钢琴谱表；上谱表有四个四分音符及歌词 Sing a short song，低音声部持续奏 C。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:181
msgid "A named melody with a verse and a bass staff."
msgstr "带有一段歌词和低音谱表的命名旋律。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:191
msgid "Read local files"
msgstr "读取本地文件"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:194
msgid ""
"A directive can name a local file instead of containing an inline body. "
"We use exactly one source form."
msgstr "指令可以指定本地文件，代替内联正文。我们只使用一种来源形式。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:203
msgid ""
"Nested ``\\include`` paths resolve beside the including file, then "
"through the source directory and configured ``include_roots``. Resolved "
"paths must stay inside the allowed roots, including after symbolic links "
"are checked. The build tracks source files, nested includes, missing "
"local lookups and selected text font files by content. Changing a "
"dependency rebuilds the generated image. Identical output bytes retain "
"the same asset name."
msgstr ""
"嵌套的 ``\\include`` 路径先在包含文件旁解析，再查找源码目录及配置的 "
"``include_roots``。解析后的路径必须保持在允许的根目录内，符号链接检查后也是如此。构建按内容跟踪源码文件、嵌套包含项、本地缺失查找及选中的文字字体文件。依赖项改变会重新生成图像。相同的输出字节保留相同的资源名称。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:209
msgid ""
"``--untrusted`` permits inline notation because the reader runs no "
"program or Scheme code. It refuses file arguments and filesystem includes "
"before opening them. Trusted text output and fallback code blocks "
"substitute external ``.ly`` source without engraving. When the file "
"cannot be read, as in an untrusted build, the output names the score file "
"in a sentence instead of showing its path as code. A failed drawing "
"retains source code with a warning; ``-W`` stops publication and "
"preserves the preceding output."
msgstr "``--untrusted`` 允许内联记谱，因为读取器不运行程序或 Scheme 代码。它会在打开文件前拒绝文件参数和文件系统包含项。受信任构建的文本输出和回退代码块会直接代入外部 ``.ly`` 源码而不排印乐谱。无法读取文件时（例如在非受信任构建中），输出会用一句话指明乐谱文件，而不是把其路径当作代码显示。绘制失败会保留源码并发出警告；``-W`` 停止发布并保留上一次输出。"

