"``lilypond_pdf_width``。数值单位为排版点。设置约定参见 :doc:`../reference/configuration`。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:240
msgid ""
"When a drawing is wider than 225 points, HTML also receives a narrow "
"edition engraved at 225 points with a staff height no greater than 14 "
"points. The browser selects it below 40 rem through a ``picture`` "
"element. This edition has its own system breaks. When its system limit "
"prevents it from being drawn, the wide image scales to the screen. SVG "
"adapts its ink to the page's color scheme; PNG keeps a light background "
"panel in dark mode."
msgstr ""
"当图像宽度超过 225 点时，HTML 还会获得以 225 点宽度排印的窄版，谱表高度不超过 14 点。浏览器在宽度低于 40 rem 时通过 "
"``picture`` 元素选择它。窄版有自己的换行位置。如果谱表系统数量限制导致窄版无法绘制，宽版图像会缩放到屏幕宽度。SVG "
"的墨色适应页面配色；PNG 在深色模式下保持浅色背景面板。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:246
msgid ""
"PDF derives its measure from ``pdf_paper_size`` (``a4`` or ``letter``; "
"any other value renders as A4) and the selected template's horizontal "
"margin, then places music at its natural size. Built-in templates declare "
"their horizontal margin in their leading 256 lines with a comment such as "
"``// guidedog: margin-x = 31mm``. A custom template without the "
"declaration uses a 25 millimetre margin assumption. "
"``lilypond_pdf_width`` overrides the derived measure. Oversized music "
"scales to fit with a build warning. A score with several systems can "
"break between systems across PDF pages, with its caption after the last "
"system."
msgstr ""
"PDF 根据 ``pdf_paper_size``\\ （``a4`` 或 ``letter``；其他值按 A4 "
"排版）与所选模板的水平页边距推算行宽，并按自然尺寸放置乐谱。内置模板在前 256 行内用 ``// guidedog: margin-x = "
"31mm`` 这样的注释声明水平页边距。自定义模板未声明时，假定页边距为 25 毫米。``lilypond_pdf_width`` "
"覆盖推导出的宽度。过宽乐谱会缩放以适应宽度，并产生构建警告。含多个谱表系统的乐谱可以在系统之间跨 PDF 页面换页，图注位于最后一个系统之后。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:253
msgid "Fonts, limits and references"
msgstr "字体、限制与参考资料"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:256
msgid ""
"Music uses the unmodified Bravura 1.482 font and SMuFL metadata under the "
"SIL Open Font License. Text follows ``pdf_fonts`` and ``pdf_font_paths``, "
"with regular, bold and italic fallback faces. Glyphs become outlines, so "
"browsers and PDF readers need no installed music font. PNG export "
"requires the embedded renderer; SVG engraving remains available in builds "
"without it."
msgstr ""
"乐谱使用未经修改的 Bravura 1.482 字体及 SMuFL 元数据，遵循 SIL Open Font License。文字遵循 "
"``pdf_fonts`` 和 ``pdf_font_paths``，提供常规、粗体和斜体回退字体。字形转换为轮廓，浏览器和 PDF "
"阅读器无需安装音乐字体。PNG 导出需要内嵌渲染器；未内嵌渲染器的构建仍可排印 SVG。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:261
msgid ""
"One example accepts at most 256 KiB of source including includes, 32 "
"included files, depth 64, 20,000 events, 24 staves, two voices per staff "
"and 16 heads per chord. The reader and engraver each have a work limit of "
"eight million operations. Expanded reader allocations have a separate 64 "
"MiB allowance. A drawing has at most 64 systems and a height of 20,000 "
"points. PNG is limited to 16 million pixels and 16,384 pixels on either "
"side. A limit diagnostic identifies the source and suggests splitting the "
"example."
msgstr ""
"单个示例最多接受含包含文件在内的 256 KiB 源码、32 个包含文件、64 层嵌套、20,000 个事件、24 "
"个谱表、每个谱表两个声部和每个和弦 16 个符头。读取器和排印器各有八百万次操作的工作上限。读取器展开后的分配另有 64 MiB "
"限额。单张图最多有 64 个谱表系统，高度不超过 20,000 点。PNG 限制为一千六百万像素，任一边不超过 16,384 "
"像素。超限诊断会指出来源并建议拆分示例。"

#: ../../topics/music.rst:268
msgid ""
"For notation syntax, we consult the `LilyPond 2.24 notation reference "
"<https://lilypond.org/doc/v2.24/Documentation/notation/>`_. For glyph "
"definitions, we consult the `Standard Music Font Layout specification "
"<https://www.w3.org/2021/03/smufl14/>`_ and the `Bravura project "
"<https://github.com/steinbergmedia/bravura>`_. Engraving references "
"include Elaine Gould's *Behind Bars* and Ted Ross's *The Art of Music "
"Engraving and Processing*. For other kinds of drawing, we use "
":doc:`diagrams`."
msgstr ""
"记谱语法参见 `LilyPond 2.24 记谱参考 "
"<https://lilypond.org/doc/v2.24/Documentation/notation/>`_。字形定义参见 "
"`Standard Music Font Layout 规范 <https://www.w3.org/2021/03/smufl14/>`_ 和 "
"`Bravura 项目 <https://github.com/steinbergmedia/bravura>`_。排印参考书包括 Elaine "
"Gould 的 *Behind Bars* 和 Ted Ross 的 *The Art of Music Engraving and "
"Processing*。其他绘图使用 :doc:`diagrams`。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:1
msgid "How a project works"
msgstr "项目如何工作"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:4
msgid ""
"The project root is the directory containing ``conf.toml``. ``root_doc`` "
"names the document that starts the reading order. Guidedog discovers "
"source documents, reads them, resolves their relations, and publishes a "
"complete output generation."
msgstr ""
"项目根目录是包含 ``conf.toml`` 的目录。\\ ``root_doc`` 指定阅读顺序起点。Guidedog "
"发现并读取源文档、解析关系，发布完整输出版本。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:11
msgid ""
"Pipeline traverses discovery, source plugins, parallel reading, "
"publication gate, reference resolution, rendering, HTML plugins, and "
"atomic staging."
msgstr "流程依次经过发现源文件、源码插件、并行读取、发布门控、引用解析、渲染、HTML 插件和原子暂存切换。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:11
msgid ""
"Guidedog's end-to-end documentation and static site compilation pipeline."
msgstr "Guidedog 的端到端文档与静态站点编译流水线。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:36
msgid "Documents and resources"
msgstr "文档与资源"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:39
msgid ""
"A source suffix selects a reader. RST and project Markdown share the "
"project graph. Images and downloads are resources. Guidedog copies "
"resources that the documents use. Theme assets are listed in "
"``html_static_path``. An include must remain within the source directory "
"or the configured ``include_roots``."
msgstr ""
"文件后缀选择读取器。RST 和项目 Markdown 共享项目图。图片和下载是资源；Guidedog 复制文档使用的资源。主题资源列于 "
"``html_static_path``\\ 。包含文件必须位于源目录或配置的 ``include_roots`` 内。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:44
msgid "Separate projects and mounted sites"
msgstr "独立的项目与挂载站点"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:47
msgid ""
"We keep a manual and design records in separate projects. They have "
"different readers and different reading orders. Each project has its own "
"configuration, templates, cache, and output. The Guidedog repository uses "
"``docs/manual`` and ``docs/gds`` this way, and mounts them into the root "
"website in ``docs/conf.toml`` via ``[[site.mounts]]``."
msgstr ""
"我们把手册和设计记录放在不同的项目中，因为它们的读者和阅读顺序都不一样。每个项目都有自己的配置、模板、缓存和输出。Guidedog 仓库中的 "
"``docs/manual`` 和 ``docs/gds`` 就是这样组织的，并通过 ``docs/conf.toml`` 中的 "
"``[[site.mounts]]`` 挂载到根网站下。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:49
msgid "Incremental work"
msgstr "增量构建"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:52
msgid ""
"Guidedog records the inputs and lookups used by each output. A changed "
"source is reread. A changed dependency invalidates its users. A changed "
"template invalidates the pages whose template chain loaded it. An "
"unchanged document may be loaded from its saved object, including "
"withheld drafts and scheduled posts that become eligible on a later build "
"clock."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog "
"会记录每个输出使用的输入和查找结果。源文件改变时会重新读取，依赖改变时使其调用方失效，模板改变时使模板链加载了该模板的页面失效。未改变的文档可从已保存的对象加载，包括暂不发布的草稿以及在后续构建时钟下达到发布条件的定时文章。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:54
msgid ""
"The cache is evidence about a previous build. It is not the source of "
"truth. ``-E`` discards the saved environment for the next build. ``-a`` "
"writes all outputs. They solve different problems."
msgstr ""
"缓存是上次构建的证据，不是事实来源。\\ ``-E`` 丢弃下次构建使用的保存环境，\\ ``-a`` 写出所有输出。它们解决不同问题。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:58
msgid ""
"\\text{reuse} = \\text{same inputs} \\land \\text{same lookups} \\land "
"\\text{output exists}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{可复用} = \\text{输入相同} \\land \\text{查找结果相同} \\land \\text{输出存在}"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:62
msgid ""
"An explicit timestamp in a template is also an input to the rendered "
"page. A page that prints the current minute can change even when its "
"prose does not. We use ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` when we need a fixed build "
"time."
msgstr ""
"模板中显式写入的时间戳也是渲染页面的输入。打印当前分钟的页面，即使正文没变也可能发生变化。需要固定的构建时间时，我们使用 "
"``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH``。"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:66
msgid "Publication"
msgstr "发布"

#: ../../topics/projects.rst:69
msgid ""
"A build writes changes to a sibling staging directory. It completes that "
"directory, flushes the files and records, and then switches generations. "
"Readers see a complete previous or new publication. An interrupted commit "
"is settled on the next build. The design and its proof obligations are in "
":doc:`../internals/publication`."
msgstr ""
"构建将变化写入同级暂存目录，完成目录、刷写文件和记录后，再切换版本。读者看到完整旧版或新版。中断的提交在下次构建处理。设计和证明义务见 "
":doc:`../internals/publication`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:1
msgid "Typography for reading"
msgstr "适合阅读的排版"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:4
msgid ""
"A page should make its structure visible before the reader studies it. A "
"strong title, a quiet navigation column, and a measured text column do "
"most of the work. Color should mark a relation or an action. It should "
"not carry the meaning alone."
msgstr "页面应在细读之前展示结构。醒目的标题、安静的导航栏和适度宽的正文栏已能完成大部分工作。颜色应标明关系或操作，不独自承担含义。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:8
msgid "The web page"
msgstr "网页"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:11
msgid ""
"The custom layout has three regions: project navigation, the document, "
"and the current page's outline. Small screens use a navigation drawer. "
"The reading edition bundles Libertinus Serif and Libertinus Sans. Titles "
"use a bold serif face. Navigation, labels, and controls use its sans "
"companion. The compressed WOFF2 files are served with the site. There are "
"no font-service requests."
msgstr ""
"自定义布局分为项目导航、正文和当前页面纲要三部分，小屏使用导航抽屉。阅读版随附 Libertinus Serif 和 Libertinus "
"Sans。标题用粗体衬线字；导航、标签和控件用配套无衬线字。压缩 WOFF2 文件随站点提供，不请求字体服务。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:20
msgid ""
"Navigation column on left, main document text column in center, local "
"section outline on right."
msgstr "左侧为项目导航，中间为正文，右侧为本页标题提纲。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:20
msgid "Three-region reading layout for HTML documentation."
msgstr "HTML 文档的三栏阅读布局。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:36
msgid ""
"The built-in theme follows the operating system by default, with light "
"and dark choices; Guidedog's own documentation website defaults to the "
"light reading edition. The theme control remembers the reader's choice on "
"the same browser origin. Printed HTML uses light colors. Content and "
"navigation remain usable without JavaScript. The theme control, enhanced "
"search, and paragraph line breaking are progressive enhancements."
msgstr ""
"内置主题默认跟随操作系统，并提供浅色与深色选项；Guidedog 自身的文档网站默认采用浅色阅读版。主题控件会在同一浏览器源上记住读者的选择。打印 "
"HTML 使用浅色配色。禁用 JavaScript 后，内容和导航依然可用。主题控件、增强搜索和段落断行都属于渐进增强。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:43
msgid ""
"Every initialized project (``guidedog quickstart``, ``guidedog ssg "
"init``, and ``guidedog dsc init``) copies ``_static/typography.js`` "
"beside ``_static/guidedog.css`` and ``_static/guidedog.js`` so a project "
"owns and can edit its scripts directly. On desktop reading measures "
"(``40rem`` and wider), English prose uses paragraph-wide **Knuth-Plass "
"line breaking** in the browser across paragraphs, list items, "
"definitions, admonitions, block quotes, and footnotes, while leaving "
"tables, navigation trees, metadata headers, and figure captions ragged. "
"The script measures the loaded font, builds boxes, glue, and hyphenation "
"penalties, and chooses breaks for the whole block. Frank Liang's pattern "
"method supplies English hyphenation candidates, and break penalty widths "
"are discarded after a hyphenated break so following lines are measured "
"accurately. Inline mathematics (after MathJax finishes), footnote "
"references, superscripts, and subscripts are measured as inline atoms; "
"links keep their markup, and inline code literals may break cleanly after "
"``/`` or ``::``. The original TeX patterns and the libraries' BSD notices "
"are recorded in ``NOTICE``."
msgstr ""
"每个初始化的项目（``guidedog quickstart``、``guidedog ssg init`` 和 ``guidedog dsc "
"init``）都会在 ``_static/guidedog.css`` 与 ``_static/guidedog.js`` 旁一并复制 "
"``_static/typography.js``，使项目直接拥有并可随时修改自己的脚本。在桌面阅读行宽（``40rem`` "
"及以上）下，英文正文会在浏览器中对段落、列表项、定义项、告诫框、块引用和脚注执行整段范围的 **Knuth-Plass "
"断行算法**，同时让表格、导航树、元数据页眉和插图图注保持自然参差排版。脚本会测量已加载的字体，构建盒子、弹性胶水与断字惩罚值，并为整个块选出断行位置。Frank "
"Liang 的模式方法提供英文断字候选点，且连字符断行后会丢弃惩罚宽度，以便精确测量后续各行。行内数学公式（MathJax "
"渲染完成后）、脚注引用、上标和下标按不可拆分的原子测量；链接保留原有标记，行内代码字面量则可在 ``/`` 或 ``::`` 之后干净换行。原始 "
"TeX 断字模式及各库的 BSD 许可声明均记录在 ``NOTICE`` 中。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:57
msgid ""
"The enhancement preserves emphasis and the exact source text. It "
"recalculates when the reading measure changes. Copying within or across "
"typeset blocks gives the source text, without visual line divisions or "
"added hyphens. Narrow screens (below ``40rem``) and printing restore "
"ordinary layout so mobile browsers wrap naturally and print engines can "
"paginate paragraphs."
msgstr ""
"该增强排版保留强调格式与精确的原始文本，并在阅读行宽变化时重新计算。在已排版的块内或跨多个块复制时，得到的都是原始文本，不含视觉换行或额外添加的连字符。窄屏（小于 "
"``40rem``）和打印会恢复普通布局，以便移动浏览器自然折行、打印引擎正常对段落分页。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:63
msgid ""
"Other languages, narrow measures, JavaScript-disabled browsers, and "
"paragraphs for which no suitably spaced solution exists use native "
"browser layout with ``text-wrap: pretty`` (without greedy CSS "
"justification or browser ``hyphens: auto``). That CSS property alone is "
"not a promise of Knuth-Plass optimization."
msgstr ""
"其他语言、窄行宽、禁用 JavaScript 的浏览器，以及找不到合适字距方案的段落，均使用带 ``text-wrap: pretty`` "
"的浏览器原生布局（不启用贪婪的 CSS 两端对齐或浏览器的 ``hyphens: auto``）。单靠这一 CSS 属性并不保证 "
"Knuth-Plass 优化。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:68
msgid "The PDF page"
msgstr "PDF 页面"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:71
msgid ""
"The book and standalone article templates use the same Libertinus family "
"as the web edition. They set justified paragraphs, optimized line "
"breaking, and language-aware hyphenation. They also control spacing, "
"running heads, captions, code blocks, and table rules. The font, "
"hyphenation cost, and paragraph measure work together. A forced line "
"break is rarely the right repair for a loose paragraph."
msgstr ""
"书籍模板和独立文章模板使用与网页版相同的 Libertinus "
"字体，设置两端对齐段落、优化断行和按语言生效的断词，同时也控制间距、页眉、题注、代码块和表格线。字体、断词成本与段落宽度协同作用。强制换行通常不能正确修复松散段落。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:73
msgid ""
"Typst optimizes the PDF paragraphs. The web enhancement optimizes "
"eligible prose. They share the source, fonts, and visual hierarchy. Their "
"line breaks can differ. See the `Typst text contract "
"<https://typst.app/docs/reference/text/text/>`_ and the `browser "
"hyphenation contract "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/hyphens>`_."
msgstr ""
"Typst 优化 PDF 段落，Web 增强优化适用正文。它们共享源文、字体和视觉层级，但断行可能不同。见 `Typst 文本契约 "
"<https://typst.app/docs/reference/text/text/>`_ 和 `浏览器断词契约 "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/hyphens>`_\\ "
"。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:78
msgid "Change the design"
msgstr "修改设计"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:81
msgid ""
"Edit ``_static/editorial.css`` for the documentation project's visual "
"tokens. Edit ``_templates/layout.html`` for structure. Edit "
"``_templates/theme.typ`` for the PDF palette and typography. Edit "
"``_templates/book.typ`` for book structure, ``_templates/discussion.typ`` "
"for discussion structure, and ``_templates/article.typ`` for standalone "
"article PDFs. All three layouts wrap their content with the shared "
"language-aware theme. Keep reading order, focus indicators, labels, and "
"sufficient contrast intact."
msgstr ""
"编辑 ``_static/editorial.css`` 调整文档项目的视觉变量，编辑 ``_templates/layout.html`` "
"调整结构，编辑 ``_templates/theme.typ`` 调整 PDF 配色和字体排印。编辑 "
"``_templates/book.typ`` 调整书籍结构，编辑 ``_templates/discussion.typ`` "
"调整讨论记录结构，编辑 ``_templates/article.typ`` 调整独立文章 "
"PDF。这三种布局都会用共享的语言感知主题包裹正文内容。请保留阅读顺序、焦点指示、标签和足够的对比度。"

#: ../../topics/typography.rst:83
msgid ""
"Build both targets after a change. Inspect a page with code, a table, a "
"diagram, and an equation. An attractive cover is not proof that the rest "
"of the book works. We build our own design in "
":doc:`../tutorial/a-custom-theme`. The full template contract is in "
":doc:`../templates`. The Rust API of Guidedog's crates is documented in "
"the separate ``docs/api`` project."
msgstr ""
"修改后要同时构建两种输出。检查一个包含代码、表格、图示和公式的页面。封面漂亮，并不说明书的其余部分没有问题。我们在 "
":doc:`../tutorial/a-custom-theme` 中构建自己的设计。完整的模板契约见 "
":doc:`../templates`。Guidedog 各 crate 的 Rust API 在独立的 ``docs/api`` 项目中提供文档。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:1
msgid "Authoring documents"
msgstr "编写文档"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:4
msgid ""
"Guidedog supports both reStructuredText (``.rst``) and MyST Markdown "
"(``.md``). Both are parsed into the same document tree. The HTML website "
"and the PDF book are made from that tree."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 同时支持 reStructuredText（``.rst``）和 MyST "
"Markdown（``.md``）。两者都解析为同一种文档树，HTML 网站和 PDF 书籍都由这棵树生成。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:8
msgid "Choose a source language"
msgstr "选择源文件语言"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:11
msgid ""
"We use reStructuredText when we need full access to domains, complex "
"tables, and extensible directives. We use MyST Markdown when we prefer "
"Markdown syntax but still want Sphinx-style directives and roles."
msgstr ""
"需要完整使用域、复杂表格和可扩展的指令时，我们使用 reStructuredText。更喜欢 Markdown 语法、同时又想使用 Sphinx "
"风格的指令和角色时，我们使用 MyST Markdown。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:15
msgid ""
"In a documentation project, Markdown documents are parsed as MyST. "
"Single-document conversions with ``guidedog convert`` read Markdown as "
"plain CommonMark 0.31.2: MyST's directives, roles, and settings belong to "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"在文档项目中，Markdown 文档按 MyST 解析。使用 ``guidedog convert`` 转换单个文档时，Markdown 按纯 "
"CommonMark 0.31.2 读取：MyST 的指令、角色和设置只属于项目。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:19
msgid "Headings and structure"
msgstr "标题与结构"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:22
msgid ""
"A document title identifies the page. Sections and subsections divide the "
"text. In reStructuredText, headings use underline adornments (and "
"optional matching overlines). The underline must be at least as long as "
"the text."
msgstr ""
"文档标题标识页面，章节和小节划分正文。在 reStructuredText "
"中，标题使用下划线装饰（也可以加上相同的上划线）。下划线的长度不能短于标题文字。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:26
msgid "Recommended adornment styles:"
msgstr "建议的标题符号："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:45
msgid ""
"We keep heading levels consistent across the project. In MyST Markdown, "
"we use standard hashes (``#``, ``##``, ``###``)."
msgstr "我们在整个项目中保持标题层级一致。在 MyST Markdown 中，使用标准的井号（``#``、``##``、``###``）。"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:48
msgid "Text formatting and inline markup"
msgstr "文字格式与行内标记"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:51
msgid "Inline markup carries meaning, not decoration:"
msgstr "行内标记表达的是含义，而不是装饰："

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:53
msgid "Inline markup"
msgstr "行内标记"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:57
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../topics/writing.rst:58
